# Harness runtime state. `.claude/` itself is TRACKED here — the agents, skills, scripts and lessons
# are the project's process, and an untracked harness has no history and cannot be reviewed in a diff.
# What follows is the state those scripts write at runtime, which is not source.

.run/
.candidates.jsonl
.hook-heartbeat.jsonl
.hook-heartbeat.json
.run-ledger.json
.loop-state.json
.verify-state.json
.claim-state.json
.review-state.json
.lessons-state.json
.analyze-state.json
.harness-selftest.json
.DS_Store
